	/// Net reduction in open voids for the current calendar month = [Voids Completed This Month] - [Voids Created This Month]. Positive = backlog shrinking (more completed than created); negative = backlog growing. Fixed to the current month via TODAY() — does NOT respond to the Date Table slicer.
	measure 'Net Void Movement (Current Month)' = [Voids Completed This Month] - [Voids Created This Month]
		formatString: #,##0;-#,##0
		displayFolder: 08. Void Management\Trends
		lineageTag: 79d77a47-a4e1-491d-b86d-e8b8b165666f

	/// Count of tenancies that were active at any point during the selected period from Date Table. A tenancy is active if it started before or during the period AND has not vacated before the period started. Excludes Cancelled tenancies. Use with Date Table slicers (Year, Month) to analyze historical tenancy counts. Note: This measure uses the Date Table as a disconnected slicer - filters on Property, Tenancy Type, etc. are preserved. Occupancy basis: a tenancy counts towards occupancy only once the household has taken up the place - that is, the tenancy has been activated, or it is recorded as Active, Active Arrears, Vacated, Vacated Arrears or Vacated Closed Account. Agreements that have been created but not yet activated, and cancelled agreements, are not counted as occupying a place.
	measure 'Active Tenancies (Period)' =
			VAR PeriodStart = MIN('Date Table'[Calendar Date])
			VAR PeriodEnd = MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date])
			RETURN
			COUNTROWS(
			    FILTER(
			        'Tenancy',
			        'Tenancy'[Tenancy Start Date] <= PeriodEnd &&
			        (ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date]) || 'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= PeriodStart) &&
			        'Tenancy'[Is Occupying Tenancy] = 1
			    )
			)
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 02. Tenancy\By Status
		lineageTag: b3546e2a-b337-48d7-8c86-f8d52e70f21d

	/// HUD Definition: Count of unique Transitional Housing households (primary tenants only) that genuinely entered the service during the selected month. Uses chain logic: only counts tenancies where Is New Chain = 1 (the first tenancy in a continuous stay chain). Excludes tenancies with Tenancy Status = Cancelled. Internal transfers within the TH service (gap <=3 days between tenancies) are part of the same chain and are NOT counted as new entries. Responds to the Date Table slicer (uses the month of the selected date); defaults to the current month when no date is selected. Caveat: chain identity depends on Tangata Whaiora ID; ~75% of historical TH tenancies have a blank client ID, so new-chain detection and entry counts may be less reliable for older records.
	measure 'TH Households Entered (Period)' =
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _ReferenceDate =
			    IF(
			        _IsDateFiltered,
			        MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]),
			        TODAY()
			    )
			VAR _MonthStart = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, -1) + 1
			VAR _MonthEnd = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, 0)
			RETURN
			CALCULATE(
			    COUNTROWS('Tenancy'),
			    'Property'[Program] = "Transitional Housing",
			    'Tenant'[Is Primary Tenant] = 1,
			    'Tenancy'[Tenancy Status] <> "Cancelled",
			    'Tenancy'[Tenancy Start Date] >= _MonthStart,
			    'Tenancy'[Tenancy Start Date] <= _MonthEnd,
			    'Tenancy'[Is New Chain] = 1  -- Only count first tenancy of each chain (new household entries)
			)
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Service Flows
		lineageTag: fb9d91f2-eabf-48f9-b30b-cb0a084b0f8c

	/// HUD Definition: Count of unique Transitional Housing chains (households) that were in service at any point during the rolling 12-month period ending at the selected date. Uses chain logic to count continuous stays as single households - internal transfers (gap <=3 days) are part of the same chain. A chain was active if it started before/during the period AND either is still active (no Vacated Date) or the final vacate was within/after the 12-month window. Uses primary tenant records and excludes tenancies with Tenancy Status = Cancelled. Use the Date Table slicer to view historical periods; defaults to the current date when no date is selected. Caveat: chains are keyed on (Chain ID + Tangata Whaiora ID + Chain Start Date); ~75% of historical TH tenancies have a blank Tangata Whaiora ID, so distinct households sharing a Chain ID / Chain Start Date cannot be separated and the count may be understated for older/blank-client records.
	measure 'TH Households Serviced (12M)' =
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _ReferenceDate =
			    IF(
			        _IsDateFiltered,
			        MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]),
			        TODAY()
			    )
			VAR _StartDate = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, -12) + 1
			VAR _EndDate = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, 0)
			
			// All TH tenancies for primary tenants (excluding cancelled)
			VAR AllTHTenancies =
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        'Tenancy',
			        'Property'[Program] = "Transitional Housing",
			        'Tenant'[Is Primary Tenant] = 1,
			        'Tenancy'[Tenancy Status] <> "Cancelled"
			    )
			
			// Get chain-level summary with min start date and max vacated date
			VAR ChainSummary =
			    SUMMARIZE(
			        AllTHTenancies,
			        'Tenancy'[Chain ID],
			        'Tenancy'[Tangata Whaiora ID],
			        'Tenancy'[Chain Start Date],
			        "MaxVacatedDate", MAX('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])
			    )
			
			// Filter to chains that were active during the 12-month window
			// A chain was active if: Chain Start Date <= _EndDate AND (MaxVacatedDate >= _StartDate OR MaxVacatedDate is blank)
			VAR ActiveChains =
			    FILTER(
			        ChainSummary,
			        'Tenancy'[Chain Start Date] <= _EndDate &&
			        (
			            ISBLANK([MaxVacatedDate]) ||
			            [MaxVacatedDate] >= _StartDate
			        )
			    )
			
			RETURN
			    COUNTROWS(ActiveChains)
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Service Flows
		lineageTag: 66ca5bf0-f68a-4573-bf2f-724064757c3e

	/// HUD Definition: Count of Transitional Housing primary-tenant tenancies whose Vacated Date falls in the selected period and whose exit outcome is Internal Transfer (a move between Emerge services). This counts tenancy-level transfer-out (vacate) events for primary tenants. It is not de-duplicated to distinct chains or households, so a household with more than one transfer in the period is counted more than once. These transfers are left out of the exit counts because they are movement within the organisation rather than a true service exit. Responds to the Date Table slicer across the whole selected range; defaults to the current month when no date is selected.
	measure 'TH Internal Transfer-Out Events (Period)' =
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _StartDate = IF(_IsDateFiltered, MIN('Date Table'[Calendar Date]), EOMONTH(TODAY(), -1) + 1)
			VAR _EndDate = IF(_IsDateFiltered, MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]), EOMONTH(TODAY(), 0))
			RETURN
			CALCULATE(
			    COUNTROWS('Tenancy'),
			    'Property'[Program] = "Transitional Housing",
			    'Tenant'[Is Primary Tenant] = 1,
			    'Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Internal Transfer",
			    REMOVEFILTERS('Tenancy'[Leaving Reason]),
			    'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _StartDate,
			    'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _EndDate
			)
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Service Flows
		lineageTag: 5703c147-53c1-492d-8881-52bdb121ae3a

	/// HUD Definition: Percentage of Transitional Housing households referred by MSD in the selected month. Placeholder returning BLANK. Referral tables exist (Transitional Housing Referrals, Tenancy Referral Bridge; Tenancy[Most Recent Referrer]) but a validated MSD referral-source flag has not yet been modelled - implement once MSD can be reliably identified from the referrer/funder fields.
	measure 'TH Rate MSD Referrals Monthly %' = BLANK()
		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Service Flows
		lineageTag: d93348ba-14a1-4df3-8302-a97c07eeef8e

	/// HUD Definition: Percentage of Transitional Housing households referred by MSD over the rolling 12-month period. Placeholder returning BLANK. Referral tables exist (Transitional Housing Referrals, Tenancy Referral Bridge; Tenancy[Most Recent Referrer]) but a validated MSD referral-source flag has not yet been modelled - implement once MSD can be reliably identified from the referrer/funder fields.
	measure 'TH Rate MSD Referrals Yearly %' = BLANK()
		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Service Flows
		lineageTag: 4834de80-9993-461e-a786-9de6d8839cd5

	/// Current count of active Transitional Housing properties (Acquired Date on or before today and not yet disposed per Confirmed Disposal Date), regardless of occupancy status - the total contracted places currently available in the TH program. CURRENT SNAPSHOT: uses TODAY() and ignores the Date Table slicer, so it will not vary by a selected month. For a point-in-time-by-date value, use a date-aware occupancy measure.
	measure 'TH Places Contracted (Current)' =
			CALCULATE(
			    COUNTROWS('Property'),
			    'Property'[Program] = "Transitional Housing",
			    FILTER(
			        'Property',
			        'Property'[Acquired Date] <= TODAY()
			            && ( ISBLANK('Property'[Confirmed Disposal Date]) || 'Property'[Confirmed Disposal Date] > TODAY() )
			    )
			)
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Occupancy
		lineageTag: 0e9ca517-6664-4d2c-8359-cbb0881ed407

	/// Number of Transitional Housing properties occupied at the end of the selected period, or today when no date is selected. A property is occupied when it has a tenancy that has started and is still in place at the end of that day. A tenancy that ends on the last day of the period no longer counts, so that property is unoccupied at the period end, while a tenancy that starts on that day does count. Only properties held at the end of the period are included: acquired by then and not disposed of before it. Shows 1 on the row of an occupied property and the count on a total. Used for occupancy rate calculations. Occupancy basis: a tenancy counts towards occupancy only once the household has taken up the place - that is, the tenancy has been activated, or it is recorded as Active, Active Arrears, Vacated, Vacated Arrears or Vacated Closed Account. Agreements that have been created but not yet activated, and cancelled agreements, are not counted as occupying a place.
	measure 'TH Places Occupied (Period End)' =
			// Date-aware count of occupied TH properties at the END of the selected date range
			// Works at property level (returns 1/0) and total level (returns count)
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _AsAtDate = IF(_IsDateFiltered, MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]), TODAY())
			
			VAR _THProperties =
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        SELECTCOLUMNS('Property', "PropID", 'Property'[Property ID]),
			        'Property'[Program] = "Transitional Housing",
			        'Property'[Acquired Date] <= _AsAtDate,
			        ISBLANK('Property'[Confirmed Disposal Date]) || 'Property'[Confirmed Disposal Date] >= _AsAtDate
			    )
			
			VAR _THtenancies =
			    CALCULATETABLE(
			        SELECTCOLUMNS(
			            'Tenancy',
			            "PropID", 'Tenancy'[Property ID],
			            "StartDate", 'Tenancy'[Tenancy Start Date],
			            "VacatedDate", 'Tenancy'[Vacated Date]
			        ),
			        FILTER ( ALL ( 'Tenancy' ), 'Tenancy'[Is Occupying Tenancy] = 1 )
			    )
			
			VAR _PropertiesWithStatus =
			    ADDCOLUMNS(
			        _THProperties,
			        "IsOccupied",
			        VAR _PropID = [PropID]
			        VAR _PropTenancies = FILTER(_THtenancies, [PropID] = _PropID)
			        RETURN
			            COUNTROWS(
			                FILTER(
			                    _PropTenancies,
			                    [StartDate] <= _AsAtDate &&
			                    (ISBLANK([VacatedDate]) || [VacatedDate] > _AsAtDate)
			                )
			            ) > 0
			    )
			
			RETURN COUNTROWS(FILTER(_PropertiesWithStatus, [IsOccupied]))
		formatString: #,0
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Occupancy
		lineageTag: 88c2a1c8-5e48-4c36-ae06-a474b4b04acf

	/// Share of Transitional Housing exits whose exit outcome is Positive (long-term sustainable housing). Window = the single calendar month containing the latest date in your Date selection, so a multi-month range returns only that last month; with no date selected it uses the current month. The denominator is every Transitional Housing exit in the month that is not an internal transfer, including exits whose exit outcome is Unclassified or blank, so the positive, negative and neutral rates need not add to 100%. Per HUD THVM Dashboard spec. For a rate over the full selected period, use 'TH Positive Exit Rate (Period) %'.
	measure 'TH Positive Exit Rate % (Current)' = ```
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _ReferenceDate = 
			    IF(
			        _IsDateFiltered,
			        MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]),
			        TODAY()
			    )
			VAR _MonthStart = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, -1) + 1
			VAR _MonthEnd = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, 0)
			VAR _TotalExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            NOT('Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Internal Transfer")
			        )
			    )
			VAR _PositiveExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            'Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Positive"
			        )
			    )
			RETURN
			    DIVIDE(_PositiveExits, _TotalExits, BLANK())
			```
		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Exits
		lineageTag: e6c5525c-07bf-427b-bbb9-e385c39376dc

	/// Share of Transitional Housing exits in the selected month whose exit outcome is Negative (household in a worse situation). Window = the single calendar month containing the latest date in the Date selection; a multi-month range returns only that last month, and with no date selected it uses the current month. Internal transfers between Emerge services are excluded from both numerator and denominator. The denominator is every Transitional Housing exit in the month that is not an internal transfer, including exits whose exit outcome is Unclassified or blank, so the positive, negative and neutral rates need not add to 100%. Stored as 0 to 1, shown as a percentage. Per HUD THVM Dashboard specifications.
	measure 'TH Negative Exit Rate % (Current)' = ```
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _ReferenceDate = 
			    IF(
			        _IsDateFiltered,
			        MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]),
			        TODAY()
			    )
			VAR _MonthStart = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, -1) + 1
			VAR _MonthEnd = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, 0)
			VAR _TotalExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            NOT('Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Internal Transfer")
			        )
			    )
			VAR _NegativeExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            'Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Negative"
			        )
			    )
			RETURN
			    DIVIDE(_NegativeExits, _TotalExits, BLANK())
			```
		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Exits
		lineageTag: fb959c89-a048-4b29-83d6-9d683ea32452

	/// Share of Transitional Housing exits in the selected month whose exit outcome is Neutral (not long-term housing but not negative). Window = the single calendar month containing the latest date in the Date selection; a multi-month range returns only that last month, and with no date selected it uses the current month. Internal transfers between Emerge services are excluded from both numerator and denominator. The denominator is every Transitional Housing exit in the month that is not an internal transfer, including exits whose exit outcome is Unclassified or blank, so the positive, negative and neutral rates need not add to 100%. Stored as 0 to 1, shown as a percentage. Per HUD THVM Dashboard specifications.
	measure 'TH Neutral Exit Rate % (Current)' = ```
			VAR _IsDateFiltered = ISFILTERED('Date Table')
			VAR _ReferenceDate = 
			    IF(
			        _IsDateFiltered,
			        MAX('Date Table'[Calendar Date]),
			        TODAY()
			    )
			VAR _MonthStart = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, -1) + 1
			VAR _MonthEnd = EOMONTH(_ReferenceDate, 0)
			VAR _TotalExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            NOT('Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Internal Transfer")
			        )
			    )
			VAR _NeutralExits = 
			    COUNTROWS(
			        FILTER(
			            'Tenancy',
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] >= _MonthStart &&
			            'Tenancy'[Vacated Date] <= _MonthEnd &&
			            NOT(ISBLANK('Tenancy'[Vacated Date])) &&
			            RELATED('Property'[Program]) = "Transitional Housing" &&
			            'Tenancy'[Exit Outcome] = "Neutral"
			        )
			    )
			RETURN
			    DIVIDE(_NeutralExits, _TotalExits, BLANK())
			```
		formatString: 0.0%
		displayFolder: 09. THVM Dashboard\Exits
		lineageTag: 1f837e5f-661a-47e8-898a-6702bf2b307b

	/// Count of Transitional Housing exits whose exit outcome is Positive (long-term sustainable housing), over the 12 calendar months ending with the month of the latest selected date; with no date selected, the 12 months ending with the current month. Internal transfers excluded. Per HUD THVM Dashboard spec.
	measure 'TH Positive Exits (12M)' = ```
