	/// Current snapshot: the highest weekly rent (Current Rent) among Transitional Housing properties whose Status is OCCUPIED right now, within the active portfolio (Acquired on/before today and not yet disposed by Confirmed Disposal Date). Reflects current state as at today and IGNORES the Date slicer.
	measure 'TH Max Weekly Contribution (Occupied, Current)' =
