	/// Sum of aged debt in the 91-or-more day overdue bucket ('Aged Debt'[91 Plus Days]) - the oldest arrears. Snapshot measure - slice the Aged Debt fact to a single snapshot ('Aged Debt'[Current Date] = "Today" or one As At Year Month) or it sums across all stored monthly snapshots. Does not respond to the Date Table slicer. A negative amount is owed by the tenant.
	measure 'Total 91 Plus' = SUM('Aged Debt'[91 Plus Days])
		formatString: \$#,0.00;-\$#,0.00;\$#,0.00
		displayFolder: 04. Financial\Aged Debt\Ageing Buckets
		lineageTag: cc607a02-0492-49f7-bdb8-0916eaf0d4f4

