	/// Sum of aged debt overdue 29 or more days (Total 29 to 60 + Total 61 to 90 + Total 91 Plus). Snapshot measure - slice the Aged Debt fact to a single snapshot ('Aged Debt'[Current Date] = "Today" or one As At Year Month) or it sums across all stored monthly snapshots. Does not respond to the Date Table slicer. A negative amount is owed by the tenant.
	measure 'Total 29 Plus' = [Total 29 to 60] + [Total 61 to 90] + [Total 91 Plus]
		formatString: \$#,0.00;-\$#,0.00;\$#,0.00
		displayFolder: 04. Financial\Aged Debt\Ageing Buckets
		lineageTag: 6eb9eef1-be7a-4ea3-9de1-3befc15dccb9

